---
import RecordingLibrary from '../RecordingLibrary.astro';
---

<section id="cases" class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2>05 Case Studies</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        The selected comparisons illustrate two observations: in-context learning (ICL) can guide
        task-specific manipulation, and task-level adaptation does not guarantee precise execution. The
        teacup and glasses recordings reveal <strong>complementary capabilities</strong>:
        GPT-6-Astra revises grasps and recovers disrupted goals, while post-trained policies execute
        fine manipulation more accurately in these examples.
      </p>
    </div>
    <section id="case-icl" class="case-study-section" aria-labelledby="case-icl-title">
      <h3 id="case-icl-title">In-Context Learning</h3>
      <div class="case-study-content"></div>
    </section>
    <section id="case-adapt" class="case-study-section" aria-labelledby="case-adapt-title">
      <h3 id="case-adapt-title">Adaptation and Precision</h3>
      <div class="case-study-content"></div>
    </section>
    <RecordingLibrary />
  </div>
</section>
